  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Assistance to Vulnerable Palestinians in Gaza Strip</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food-insecure and vulnerable Palestinians living in the Gaza Strip are supported to meet their essential food and nutrition needs. The Norwegian grant will enable World Food Program WFP to provide electronic food voucher assistance to around 20,100 people in the Gaza Strip for 12 months.
This project aims to target selected households in Gaza, the majority of whom are registered by UNRWA as refugees.</narrative>
  </description>
